        <VALUE Lang="tw">Enhance value will be applied 隨機的 within the套裝範圍. Please note that it can be used again on an物品 that is already 增強的and such value will not be decreased. Left click to select and p花邊it over the 防具 to enhance then right click to us</VALUE>
