    </SENTENSE>
    <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ID_3163_152">
        <VALUE Lang="tw">Using this item will recharge battery by 50% when currently using bike's battery gauge hits '0' or is almost at '0'. Un-equip the Bike to inventory and then click right mouse button on the bike when Battery Item is selected.</VALUE>
